{"File":"/home/prem/Projects/Flightreader/SPECS.md","LineNumber":1219,"LineContent":"Satellite positioning engines (GPS, GLONASS, BeiDou, Galileo, RTK) calculate elevation relative to the mathematical **WGS84 Reference Ellipsoid** ($h$). Real-world aviation safety and human airspace regulations mandate elevation above the Earth's physical **Mean Sea Level (MSL)**, defined by the **EGM2008 Geoid** ($H$)."}
