{"File":"/home/prem/Projects/Flightreader/SPECS.md","LineNumber":1254,"LineContent":"### 7.2 EGM2008 PGM Raster Structure \u0026 Bilinear Grid Interpolation"}
{"File":"/home/prem/Projects/Flightreader/SPECS.md","LineNumber":1256,"LineContent":"The Earth Gravitational Model 2008 (EGM2008) is distributed by the National Geospatial-Intelligence Agency (NGA) as an uncompressed 16-bit raster grid file (`egm2008-1.pgm` for 1-arc-minute resolution, or `egm2008-5.pgm` for 5-arc-minute resolution) formatted in Netpbm P5 format:"}
{"File":"/home/prem/Projects/Flightreader/SPECS.md","LineNumber":1442,"LineContent":"                                   (EGM2008 PGM Bilinear Interp)"}
